e Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nAdam has claustrophobia and gets extremely uncomfortable in small or crowded spaces. Last night, his friend invited him to his spacious garden home for a barbeque dinner.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Adam ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Relief & Embarrassment\nB) Disapproval & Nervousness\nC) Jealousy & Gratitude\nD) Relief & Gratitude\nE) Embarrassment & Jealousy\nF) Disapproval & Embarrassment\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Adam feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) His friend invited him to his house for dinner & His friend delivered his favorite food to his home\nB) His friend invited him to his house for dinner & The house is spacious and he doesn't have to worry about his phobia\nC) His friend invited him to his house for dinner & He is terrified of his friend's house\nD) The house is spacious and he doesn't have to worry about his phobia & He is terrified of his friend's house\nE) His friend invited him to his house for dinner & He thinks his friend did not consider his phobia\nF) He is terrified of his friend's house & He probably won a trophy at the barbeque party","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068938921490877,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7aa9aa9dc5a833d9fc8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484138214,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:48:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"af83